      "content": "the performance is just so draining. every morning feels like i'm just pulling on a mask that doesn't fit anymore. there's something so seductive about the idea of just... not being part of the noise. like, if I could just slip into that mist and let the stillness be my final rest. wouldnt that be a beautiful way for it all to just end? just a quiet departure into the dark?",
